WEBVTT

00:02.945 --> 00:05.841
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:05.910 --> 00:11.324
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:11.393 --> 00:15.186
- Oh, Gary.
Who wants snackies?
- 哦，加里。
谁想要零食？

00:15.255 --> 00:16.703
Come on, Gar-bear.
来吧，加熊。

00:16.772 --> 00:20.255
I promised you a treat if
you got an A on your math test.
我答应过你请客如果
你的数学考试得了A。

00:20.324 --> 00:22.945
Here, snaily, snaily, snaily.
在这里，蜗牛，蜗牛，蜗牛。

00:23.014 --> 00:24.876
Where are you, boy?
孩子，你在哪里？

00:24.945 --> 00:26.738
Gary?
加里？

00:26.807 --> 00:28.772
Gary?
加里？

00:28.841 --> 00:30.014
- [echoes] Meow.
- [回声] 喵。

00:30.083 --> 00:31.807
- Hmm?
- 唔？

00:31.876 --> 00:32.841
- [echoes] Meow.
- [回声] 喵。

00:32.910 --> 00:35.600
- Uh, Gary?
- 呃，加里？

00:35.669 --> 00:37.117
[gargles]
[漱口]

00:37.186 --> 00:38.427
- [hums]
- [哼哼]

00:38.496 --> 00:39.807
Huh?
- Gary?
啊？
- 加里？

00:39.876 --> 00:42.841
[woman screams]
- [screams]
[女人尖叫]
- [尖叫]

00:42.910 --> 00:44.221
[flushes]
[脸红]

00:44.290 --> 00:45.945
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

00:49.945 --> 00:50.910
- Meow.
- 喵。

00:50.979 --> 00:53.634
- Gary?
- 加里？

00:53.703 --> 00:54.876
- Meow.
- 喵。

00:54.945 --> 00:56.703
Meow. Meow.
喵。喵。

00:56.772 --> 00:59.772
- Did that lump in my wall
always meow?
- 我的墙上有那个肿块吗
总是喵？

00:59.841 --> 01:01.117
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:01.186 --> 01:03.186
- Gary, how'd you get in there?
- 加里，你怎么进去的？

01:03.255 --> 01:05.014
And how do I get you out?
我怎样才能把你救出来呢？

01:05.083 --> 01:06.496
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:08.807 --> 01:10.117
- Hmm...
- 唔...

01:10.186 --> 01:11.324
Ah!
啊!

01:14.117 --> 01:16.703
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:16.772 --> 01:17.703
There.
那里。

01:17.772 --> 01:19.152
[strains]
[菌株]

01:19.221 --> 01:20.600
[wind blows]
[风吹过]

01:22.703 --> 01:24.910
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:24.979 --> 01:28.358
Oh, no!
I locked myself in!
哦，不！
我把自己锁在里面了！

01:28.427 --> 01:30.358
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

01:30.427 --> 01:32.048
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:32.117 --> 01:33.117
Meow.
喵。

01:33.186 --> 01:34.634
- Hey!
- 嘿！

01:34.703 --> 01:37.221
I've been looking all over
for you, little mister.
我一直在寻找
为了你，小先生。

01:37.290 --> 01:39.496
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:39.565 --> 01:41.669
- Here, boy.
- 在这里，男孩。

01:41.738 --> 01:44.221
Whoa!
- [laughs]
哇！
- [笑]

01:44.290 --> 01:46.358
Thank you, kind stranger.
谢谢你，好心的陌生人。

01:46.427 --> 01:48.703
[laughs]
[笑]

01:48.772 --> 01:50.048
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:50.117 --> 01:51.979
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

01:52.048 --> 01:53.496
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:56.393 --> 01:57.600
Meow.
- [chuckles]
喵。
- [轻笑]

01:57.669 --> 02:00.290
- Whoa!
Who are you?
- 哇！
你是谁？

02:00.358 --> 02:02.427
- You can call me Wally C,
- 你可以叫我沃利 C，

02:02.496 --> 02:06.221
for in these walls,
I live, you see?
因为在这些墙壁里，
我还活着，你看到了吗？

02:06.290 --> 02:09.358
[laughs]
[笑]

02:09.427 --> 02:12.393
- Well, my name be
SpongeBob SquarePants
- 嗯，我的名字是
海绵宝宝

02:12.462 --> 02:15.290
for I'm a sponge
who wears square pants.
因为我是一块海绵
谁穿方裤。

02:15.358 --> 02:17.290
Hey, how did you get in here?
嘿，你怎么进来的？

02:17.358 --> 02:20.600
- Oh, long ago
-哦，很久以前

02:20.669 --> 02:25.083
a handyman was I till...
我是一名勤杂工，直到...

02:25.152 --> 02:27.152
both: Hup, hup, hup, hup,
Hup, hup, hup.
两者：哈，哈，哈，哈，
呵呵，呵呵，呵呵。

02:27.221 --> 02:28.186
- Hey!
- 嘿！

02:28.255 --> 02:30.290
Me eternal confinement.
我永恒的禁锢。

02:30.358 --> 02:31.945
[muffled screams]
[低沉的尖叫声]

02:32.014 --> 02:34.117
both: Hup, hup, hup, hup.
Hup, hup, hup, hup.
两者：哈，哈，哈，哈。
呵呵，呵呵，呵呵，呵呵。

02:34.186 --> 02:36.531
- Ooh!
- 哦！

02:38.393 --> 02:41.152
- [muffled scream]
- [低沉的尖叫声]

02:41.221 --> 02:43.531
- Is that normal?
- 这正常吗？

02:43.600 --> 02:45.979
- That's just
the house settling.
- 就是这样
房子安顿下来。

02:46.048 --> 02:47.255
[chuckles nervously]
[紧张地笑]

02:47.324 --> 02:48.979
- Sold!
- 卖！

02:49.048 --> 02:53.117
- And thus me fate
was forever cast
- 这就是我的命运
被永远铸造

02:53.186 --> 02:55.738
in drywall.
在干墙中。

02:55.807 --> 02:56.841
The end.
结束。

02:56.910 --> 02:58.393
- Mmm!
- 嗯！

02:58.462 --> 02:59.462
What?
什么？

02:59.531 --> 03:00.634
I can't believe you've been
我不敢相信你已经

03:00.703 --> 03:03.048
living in the walls
all this time.
住在墙壁里
一直以来。

03:03.117 --> 03:06.014
Hey, maybe we can
find a way out together.
嘿，也许我们可以
一起寻找出路。

03:06.083 --> 03:08.841
- Uh-uh, there be no exit
- 呃呃，没有出口

03:08.910 --> 03:12.014
once ye enter
this restrictive realm.
一旦你进入
这个限制性的领域。

03:12.083 --> 03:13.531
- Um, don't you want
to get out of here?
- 嗯，你不想吗
离开这里？

03:13.600 --> 03:14.945
- Nay!
- 不！

03:15.014 --> 03:19.255
Wally no longer cares
for the outside realm.
沃利不再关心
对于外部领域。

03:19.324 --> 03:23.255
Here, feeling cramped
be just a state of mind.
在这里，感觉局促
只是一种心态。

03:23.324 --> 03:26.221
[laughs]
[笑]

03:26.290 --> 03:28.117
- Whoa!
- 哇！

03:28.186 --> 03:30.358
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

03:30.427 --> 03:32.807
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:32.876 --> 03:36.634
- Welcome to Wallhalla!
- 欢迎来到沃尔哈拉！

03:36.703 --> 03:38.600
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:38.669 --> 03:40.807
How would you like
a grand tour?
你想要怎样
一次盛大的旅行？

03:40.876 --> 03:43.565
- Oh, we would love
the grand tour.
- 哦，我们会喜欢
盛大的旅行。

03:44.772 --> 03:46.669
[animals chittering]
[动物叽叽喳喳]

03:46.738 --> 03:50.117
- Welcome to me mold garden.
- 欢迎来到我的模具花园。

03:50.186 --> 03:53.462
Hey! Me aspergillus!
嘿！我是曲霉菌！

03:53.531 --> 03:55.841
Shoo! Shoo!
嘘！嘘！

03:55.910 --> 03:59.600
- Ooh, I see you're also
growing raisins in your garden.
- 哦，我发现你也是
在你的花园里种植葡萄干。

03:59.669 --> 04:01.738
- Raisins?
Oh, no.
- 葡萄干？
哦，不。

04:01.807 --> 04:03.772
Those are urchin droppings.
这些是海胆粪便。

04:03.841 --> 04:05.462
[laughs]
[笑]

04:05.531 --> 04:06.738
- [gags]
- [笑声]

04:09.496 --> 04:12.876
[all exclaim]
[所有人惊呼]

04:12.945 --> 04:14.910
Huh?
啊？

04:14.979 --> 04:17.565
Oh, Wally, there's a way out.
哦，沃利，有一条出路。

04:17.634 --> 04:18.669
- [laughs] Nay.
- [笑] 不。

04:18.738 --> 04:23.048
That's just me magic fridge.
这就是我的神奇冰箱。

04:23.117 --> 04:24.565
Oh! Ah!
哦！啊!

04:24.634 --> 04:26.531
[moans]
[呻吟声]

04:26.600 --> 04:27.565
Ooh!
哦！

04:27.634 --> 04:29.979
[slurps]
[啜饮]

04:30.048 --> 04:31.255
Ah.
啊。

04:31.324 --> 04:32.876
- Magic?
- 魔法？

04:32.945 --> 04:35.634
- No matter
how much I eat or drink,
- 没关系
我吃了多少或喝了多少，

04:35.703 --> 04:38.462
she always provideth more.
她总是提供更多。

04:38.531 --> 04:40.841
[laughs]
- [slurps]
[笑]
- [啜饮]

04:40.910 --> 04:44.255
Hey, I get
Tender Tummy Kelp Juice too.
嘿，我明白了
还有嫩腹海带汁。

04:44.324 --> 04:47.255
Sure tastes better
from the magic fridge, though.
当然味道更好
不过，是从魔法冰箱里拿出来的。

04:47.324 --> 04:51.910
- There be many magical
crannies in Wallhalla.
- 有很多神奇的
瓦哈拉殿堂的裂缝。

04:51.979 --> 04:53.221
- Whoa!
- 哇！

04:53.290 --> 04:58.221
- Wallhalla even has
a magic medicine cabinet
- Wallhalla甚至有
一个神奇的药柜

04:58.290 --> 05:01.221
where I keep--aha--
我保存的地方——啊哈——

05:01.290 --> 05:04.290
me magic nose brush.
我的神奇鼻刷。

05:04.358 --> 05:06.324
[snorts]
[哼哼]

05:06.393 --> 05:08.117
[laughs]
[笑]

05:09.703 --> 05:12.083
Brush the hairs
within your nose
梳理毛发
在你的鼻子里

05:12.152 --> 05:15.703
so they don't drip
upon your clothes.
所以它们不会滴水
在你的衣服上。

05:15.772 --> 05:18.083
- Wallhalla is amazing!
- 沃尔哈拉太棒了！

05:18.152 --> 05:20.841
Wow, to think that
right behind the wall
哇，想到这一点
就在墙后面

05:20.910 --> 05:23.876
is a world without problems.
是一个没有问题的世界。

05:23.945 --> 05:27.427
- Well, Wallhalla
does have one problem.
- 好吧，瓦尔哈拉
确实有一个问题。

05:27.496 --> 05:29.634
A noisy neighbor.
一个吵闹的邻居。

05:29.703 --> 05:31.910
- [gasps] No!
- [喘气]不！

05:31.979 --> 05:34.014
- Beyond these walls,
- 越过这些墙，

05:34.083 --> 05:37.703
there lives a creature
with squeaky shoes
那里住着一种生物
穿着吱吱作响的鞋子

05:37.772 --> 05:40.841
who stomps around all day.
谁整天跺脚。

05:40.910 --> 05:44.738
A monster who shrieks
with delight at all hours.
尖叫的怪物
随时充满喜悦。

05:44.807 --> 05:48.255
A beast
with an ear-piercing laugh
野兽
伴随着刺耳的笑声

05:48.324 --> 05:50.358
so annoying
太烦人了

05:50.427 --> 05:53.841
it drove me mad!
这让我发疯了！

05:53.910 --> 05:56.462
And it sounds like this.
听起来是这样的。

05:56.531 --> 05:58.462
[imitates SpongeBob's laugh]
[模仿海绵宝宝的笑声]

05:58.531 --> 05:59.807
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:59.876 --> 06:02.841
That's the most horrible thing
I've ever heard.
这才是最可怕的事情
我曾经听说过。

06:02.910 --> 06:04.393
- [sighs]
Meow.
- [叹气]
喵。

06:04.462 --> 06:08.083
- But I'm sure glad to be safe
in here with you, Wally.
- 但我很高兴能够安全
沃利，和你在一起。

06:08.152 --> 06:10.255
- Oh, SpongeBob,
- 哦，海绵宝宝，

06:10.324 --> 06:15.738
meeting ye has been
the greatest day of me life.
遇见你们已经
我一生中最伟大的一天。

06:15.807 --> 06:17.221
Or is it nighttime?
还是现在是晚上？

06:17.290 --> 06:19.772
I lost track years ago.
[wolf howls]
几年前我就失去了踪迹。
[狼嚎]

06:19.841 --> 06:23.979
What say ye
to a friendship feast?
你们说什么
去一场友谊盛宴？

06:24.048 --> 06:26.358
- Oh, I thought
you'd never ask.
- 哦，我以为
你永远不会问。

06:26.427 --> 06:28.565
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

06:28.634 --> 06:31.427
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:31.496 --> 06:33.738
both: To friendship!
双方：为了友谊！

06:33.807 --> 06:37.565
[slurp, sigh]
[啜饮，叹息]

06:37.634 --> 06:39.703
To Wallhalla!
前往沃尔哈拉！

06:39.772 --> 06:42.634
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:42.703 --> 06:43.807
- Mmm!
- 嗯！

06:43.876 --> 06:47.427
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:47.496 --> 06:49.669
[all sigh]
[众人叹息]

06:49.738 --> 06:53.979
- Hmm, Wally, that was the
friendliest feast I ever had.
- 嗯，沃利，那就是
我吃过的最友好的盛宴。

06:54.048 --> 06:56.945
Well, guess me and Gary
better find our way back home.
好吧，猜猜我和加里
最好找到回家的路。

06:57.014 --> 06:59.427
- Huh?
Who's Gary?
- 啊？
加里是谁？

06:59.496 --> 07:00.669
- Meow?
- Huh?
- 喵？
- 啊？

07:00.738 --> 07:03.186
Oh, you know,
my pet snail, Gary.
哦，你知道，
我的宠物蜗牛，加里。

07:03.255 --> 07:04.393
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

07:04.462 --> 07:06.221
- [blows raspberry]
Your pet snail?
- [吹覆盆子]
你的宠物蜗牛？

07:06.290 --> 07:08.324
He be my pet snail!
他是我的宠物蜗牛！

07:08.393 --> 07:10.290
And his name ain't Gary.
他的名字不叫加里。

07:10.358 --> 07:12.255
It's "Garr-ee."
这是“加里”。

07:12.324 --> 07:14.565
See?
看？

07:14.634 --> 07:16.634
- Oh, I get it.
- 哦，我明白了。

07:16.703 --> 07:19.427
"Garr-ee," Gary.
“加里，”加里。

07:19.496 --> 07:22.669
That's funny.
[laughs]
那很好笑。
[笑]

07:22.738 --> 07:25.427
[laugh echoing]
[笑声回响]

07:25.496 --> 07:28.186
- That haunting laugh.
——那令人难以忘怀的笑声。

07:28.255 --> 07:29.807
It was ye!
是你们！

07:29.876 --> 07:33.048
Ye who drove me mad!
你们让我发疯了！

07:33.117 --> 07:36.738
[screams]
[monkeys howl]
[尖叫声]
[猴子嚎叫]

07:36.807 --> 07:38.427
- Gulp.
- Meow.
- 咕噜咕噜。
- 喵。

07:38.496 --> 07:40.634
- I curse thee,
- 我诅咒你，

07:40.703 --> 07:43.703
SpongeBob SquarePants,
海绵宝宝，

07:43.772 --> 07:46.565
and thy irritating cackle.
还有你令人恼火的咯咯声。

07:46.634 --> 07:49.117
Now, I'm gonna
现在，我要

07:49.186 --> 07:52.876
wring the water
from your pores!
拧干水
来自你的毛孔！

07:52.945 --> 07:55.048
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

07:55.117 --> 07:57.324
Be gone from Wallhalla!
离开沃尔哈拉吧！

07:57.393 --> 07:58.910
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:58.979 --> 08:02.290
- You're breaking
me beautiful world!
- 你打破了
我美丽的世界！

08:03.531 --> 08:06.048
- SpongeBob, you home?
- 海绵宝宝，你在家吗？

08:06.117 --> 08:07.255
Hmm...hmm...
- [screams]
嗯……嗯……
- [尖叫]

08:07.324 --> 08:08.738
- If you don't come out
right now...
- 如果你不出来
现在...

08:08.807 --> 08:09.910
- Guess not.
- 我猜不是。

08:09.979 --> 08:13.738
Well, su casa es mi casa.
好吧，su casa es mi casa。

08:13.807 --> 08:16.152
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:16.221 --> 08:18.807
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

08:18.876 --> 08:21.807
I don't believe it!
我不相信！

08:21.876 --> 08:24.462
Raisins!
[laughs]
葡萄干！
[笑]

08:24.531 --> 08:28.117
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

08:28.186 --> 08:31.772
[muffled screams]
- Oh, no, you don't!
[低沉的尖叫声]
- 哦，不，你不！

08:31.841 --> 08:34.772
- Patrick, help us!
- Meow!
- 帕特里克，帮助我们！
- 喵！

08:34.841 --> 08:36.393
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

08:37.807 --> 08:40.186
- [sighs]
This show stinks.
- [叹气]
这剧真臭

08:40.255 --> 08:41.186
Boo!
嘘！

08:41.255 --> 08:43.393
[all strain]
[所有应变]

08:46.462 --> 08:48.807
Ooh, the mail is here!
哦哦，邮件来了！

08:48.876 --> 08:51.807
Well, this isn't for me.
嗯，这不适合我。

08:51.876 --> 08:55.048
I'll just return to sender.
我只会返回发件人。

08:55.117 --> 08:56.324
Go down!
下去！

08:56.393 --> 08:57.358
Oh!
哦！

08:57.427 --> 09:01.324
Ooh, not for me cookies.
哦，饼干不适合我。

09:01.393 --> 09:04.531
[munches loudly]
[大声咀嚼]

09:04.600 --> 09:06.910
[both scream]
- [growls]
[两人尖叫]
- [咆哮]

09:06.979 --> 09:09.393
- Patrick,
thank goodness you're here.
- 帕特里克，
谢天谢地你在这里。

09:09.462 --> 09:11.152
- Do you mind, SpongeBob?
- 海绵宝宝，你介意吗？

09:11.221 --> 09:14.255
I'm using the bathroom.
我正在使用浴室。

09:14.324 --> 09:17.600
- Oh, no.
I'm through the looking glass.
- 哦，不。
我透过镜子。

09:17.669 --> 09:19.979
Wallhalla's been destroyed.
沃尔哈拉已被摧毁。

09:20.048 --> 09:24.290
Ye ruined me narrow,
uncomfortable life!
你们毁了我的狭窄，
生活不舒服！

09:24.358 --> 09:25.496
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:25.565 --> 09:26.841
- Who's the crybaby?
- 谁是爱哭鬼？

09:28.634 --> 09:31.738
- Aw, there has to be one thing
from the outside world
- 哦，一定有一件事
来自外界

09:31.807 --> 09:33.600
that you miss, right?
你很想念，对吧？

09:33.669 --> 09:38.358
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:38.427 --> 09:39.738
- [sniffs deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

09:39.807 --> 09:43.427
Wait, is that a Krabby Patty?
- Mm!
等等，那是蟹黄饼吗？
- 毫米！

09:43.496 --> 09:46.427
- Okay, I admit
there was one thing I missed.
- 好吧，我承认
我错过了一件事。

09:46.496 --> 09:51.807
I've had to ration this
one Krabby Patty for decades.
我不得不配给这个
几十年来一直是一个蟹肉饼。

09:54.290 --> 09:57.427
- Hmm, I think I have an idea.
- 嗯，我想我有一个主意。

09:58.600 --> 10:02.427
Uh, Patrick, why are my mom's
cookies floating in the toilet?
呃，帕特里克，为什么是我妈妈的
饼干漂浮在厕所里？

10:02.496 --> 10:05.152
- Oh, because
I forgot to flush.
- 哦，因为
我忘了冲水。

10:05.221 --> 10:06.945
[flushes]
[脸红]

10:10.393 --> 10:13.669
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:13.738 --> 10:15.531
[bell dings]
[铃声]

10:15.600 --> 10:17.048
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

10:17.117 --> 10:19.703
Or should I say,
order down!
或者我应该说，
下单！

10:19.772 --> 10:21.738
[laughs]
[笑]

10:21.807 --> 10:24.255
- Thank ye!
- 谢谢你们！

10:24.324 --> 10:27.945
[laughs]
[笑]

10:28.014 --> 10:29.634
[cash register chimes]
Got any mustard?
[收银机铃声]
有芥末吗？

10:29.703 --> 10:32.324
- [screams]
[laughter]
- [尖叫]
[笑声]

10:32.393 --> 10:34.979
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:35.048 --> 10:38.876
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:40.910 --> 10:43.565
- [sighs]
I still hate that laugh.
- [叹气]
我还是讨厌那种笑声。

10:47.048 --> 10:49.979
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:50.048 --> 10:57.186
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪